```

Now I need to also fix the boundary condition function to handle the parameters correctly.

```json
{
  "tool": "edit_file",
  "args": {
    "path": "code/porous_traveling_wave.py",
    "old_str": "def bc(ya, yb, m, c):\n    \"\"\"Boundary conditions.\n    f(-L) = 1, f(L) = 0, where L is large.\n    \"\"\"\n    return np.array([ya[0] - 1, yb[0]])",
    "new_str": "def bc(ya, yb, m, c):\n    \"\"\"Boundary conditions.\n    f(-L) = 1, f(L) = 0, where L is large.\n    \"\"\"\n    return np.array([ya[0] - 1, yb[0]])"
  }
}
```

